      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Zhou et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Staphylococcus succinus subsp. succinus type strain DSM 14617 was isolated from plant and soil inclusions within 25- to 35-million-year-old Dominican amber. The complete genome sequence of strain DSM 14617T includes a genome of 2.88 Mb (32.94% G+C content) without any plasmids."
